Z||000003||1FST2M6||07-21-2000||01:28 PM||||for 16" 16x(?) width with 42mm offset<BR>17s 17x7-7.5 42mm   17x8-8.5 45mm offset<BR>18x8 45mm offset  <P>all having the same 5x100mm bolt pattern with 48mm hub-centric adapter.  (almost always included or cut into the wheel. Mine were Delrin from KONIG.  <A HREF="http://www.konigwheels.com" TARGET=_blank>www.konigwheels.com</A>  ||||reg||1
